        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          27       Bw, Neih, Gaanchuangcna Guay",
            "                             11.9.9.10.5.Ref.4.8.10.7.6.5",
            "",
            "          Doh hei C",
            "",
            "               1. Bw neih gaanchuangcna guay ta samc rilouna,",
            "                  Ai lunghmei kandic ta 'patlouna,",
            "                  'Zianmei nunc tat lak nimei guay ta",
            "                  Ramnavlouna Kaipouc ta ariu khang",
            "                  Kaamcthau kan ni the.",
            "",
            "                         Tingkwm ching ching",
            "                         Kata thuanh khang samc kan ni the,",
            "                         Neihriw kage maek khe, heic ramc thangc tei,",
            "                         Ryanraamei nai dat lak khe,",
            "                         ARavguangc ta how khang",
            "                         Kaamcthau kan ni the.",
            "",
            "               2. Kaidai chaeng khou ai neihlaana ruan bam ni.",
            "                  Gaanvsaekc thu maikwam khou ryanraa 'ni,",
            "                  Jisu khou lwmlou makpui zaengrui.",
            "                  Bam duc khwan tho kadylou khang maek khe.",
            "                  Kaamcthau kan ni the.",
            "",
            "               3. Tingkauh ramgai tei thow rui saa ngam ni cho!",
            "                  Kata thuanhmei khwanrui padik ge,",
            "                  Ringhmei thingbang lim gaymei khoutei.",
            "                  'Zianmei nunc lev ringhmei pyrun run khang,",
            "                  Kaamcthau kan ni the."
          ]
        }
      }
